# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Code-only policy: this repository holds the simulator, not what it produces.
# Authored cases, their materialized runtime twins and every analysis artefact
# stay local. Geometry templates under tools/Templates/ are deliberately NOT
# ignored -- the GUI ships them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

